IC LEG (r7_si_diagnostic.py, NOT a gate, unjudgeable span): z of short_ratio level cross-section -> long bottom-3/short top-3 at monthly, 7 hold months 2024-02..2024-08: mean net -0.4304 pct/mo = -5.16 pct/yr ann, SR -0.376, hit 3/7; mirrored sign +5.16 pct/yr - reported only to avoid post-hoc adoption temptation; adopting either sign from 7 obs would be p-hacking. Consolidation-date logic + PIT lag documented: CSI settles semi-monthly (mid-month + month-end), publication lag +2 trading days per charter - constructible in principle but unreachable per routes above. Charter rule honored: non-shortable universe constraint noted as MOOT (no weights ever constructed from admitted data). Champion pin unchanged 4358dfab95679b97 (n=4805, 2008-03-31..2026-08-27). Repro: coord/HUNT_SECTOR2/work_r7/{r7_admission_probe.py,.json,r7_si_diagnostic.py,.json}",HUNT_SECTOR2-R7
